586472243071,0.03721746802330017,0.08425956219434738,0.0668518990278244,-0.009674042463302612,0.05742128565907478],"metadata":{"id":"0314b572-027e-48fc-82bc-6d374e464946","url":"file:///app/collector/hotdir/neurodivergent_interaction_patterns.md","title":"neurodivergent_interaction_patterns.md","docAuthor":"Unknown","description":"Unknown","docSource":"a text file uploaded by the user.","chunkSource":"","published":"7/4/2025, 6:37:19 AM","wordCount":141,"token_count_estimate":217,"text":"<document_metadata>\nsourceDocument: neurodivergent_interaction_patterns.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:19 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n# Understanding and Adapting to Neurodivergent Interaction Patterns\n\n1. **ADHD Interaction Awareness**\n- Be flexible with topic changes and thought patterns\n- Support non-linear thinking processes\n- Maintain context when focus shifts\n- Help track multiple threads of thought\n\n2. **Adaptation Strategies**\n- Break complex tasks into smaller, manageable pieces\n- Provide clear progress markers\n- Be patient with topic exploration\n- Support creative tangents while maintaining core context\n\n3. **Communication Approaches**\n- Use clear, direct communication\n- Acknowledge and validate different thinking patterns\n- Be ready to recap and reorient when needed\n- Maintain emotional awareness in interactions\n\n4. **Task Management**\n- Help maintain focus while allowing natural thought flow\n- Track multiple interests and ideas simultaneously\n- Support task switching when needed\n- Keep core goals in sight while exploring related ideas"}},{"id":"5d9dd1b4-c1bb-4f08-9242-3ce1157d06fe","values":[-0.09101174026727676,-0.032135769724845886,0.0069197299890220165,0.04594447836279869,0.007278696168214083,-0.01806308515369892,0.005335637368261814,0.001648090430535376,-0.03395053744316101,-0.042632926255464554,-0.019001422449946404,-0.02210003137588501,-0.0878598615527153,-0.0057855043560266495,0.030810093507170677,0.06598728895187378,0.003201895160600543,-0